<title>SINGAPORE: India tenders to buy Dec 96-Mar 97 fuel oil.</title>
<headline>India tenders to buy Dec 96-Mar 97 fuel oil.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp has issued a quarterly term tender to buy high sulphur fuel oil for delivery starting from December 1996 to March 1997, industry sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender seeks 45,000 tonnes each of 3.5 percent sulphur fuel oil for delivery on a cost and freight basis to Kandla or Bombay, west coast India or on a free-on-board basis.</p>
<p>The tender closes November 20 and is valid for a day.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
